Ascended again. This time was a real pain---I had my blindfold cursed
on about level 35 (on the way out) and couldn't get it off. Even
praying didn't help---I was chaotic, but my god always seemed angry,
even after a *very* long period between prayers. Is it not possible to
pray while you have the Amulet?? Had to put on my cursed ring of
levitation to get up the stairs on the castle level---luckily, I
remembered the *one* sink!! In the end, being blinded wasn't too bad a
problem---thank goodness that the Amulet maps out parts of the level
for you, or there would have been *no* chance!! Didn't map out the
endlevel though---it was a pain finding my way around the its maze
(luckily, I was able to use a wand of digging--both my weapon and
pick-axe were cursed!) I died a few times fighting the Wizard (used 3
amulets of life saving), but in the end, made it !!!

Lawrence.


